Serve the models under a root over HTTP

<BIN> serve [OPTIONS]

OPTIONS:
  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit
          --root TEXT:DIR REQUIRED 
                              Directory holding one subdirectory per model
          --default TEXT ...  Version a request without one resolves to, as name=version.
                              Repeatable.
          --host TEXT [127.0.0.1]  
                              Address the public listener binds
          --port INT:INT in [1 - 65535] [8080]  
                              Port the public listener binds
          --admin-host TEXT [127.0.0.1]  
                              Address the admin listener binds
          --admin-port INT:INT in [1 - 65535] [8081]  
                              Port the admin listener binds
          --threads UINT:UINT in [1 - 1024] [32]  
                              Concurrent connections the public listener serves
          --max-batch-rows UINT:UINT in [1 - 4096] [32]  
                              Rows one request may carry
          --max-body-bytes UINT [8388608]  
                              Largest request body accepted
          --strict-ready      Refuse to start, and report not ready, while any model failed to
                              load
